The Live2D-Suzu host loads this plugin dynamically. Source for this plugin
is this directory. Do not copy AGPL code into modules/ or services/.

Fan Studio credentials stay in the host secret store. Do not commit API keys.
This plugin does not send telemetry to plugincenter.aloys23.link or any other
cloud ingest endpoint.

Default second-level EEW push uses Wolfx Project's public WebSocket
(wss://ws-api.wolfx.jp/all_eew). Wolfx is an unofficial community feed, not
an agency of CEA/CENC/CMA/CWA/JMA. It can lag, drop, or disagree with the
official earthquake early-warning app. Treat QQ pushes as convenience, not
a life-safety channel. Docs: https://wolfx.jp/zh/docs/open-api
